[{"title":"和刘后村梅花百咏 其三十九","author":"方蒙仲","text":"最堪避世有墙东，细别薰莸鼻观中。\n商皓芝香真可老，陶朱铜臭敢称公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9307,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘后村梅花百咏 其四十九","author":"方蒙仲","text":"含章遗迹杳难详，汉苑唐都更可伤。\n说与诗人莫嘲咏，梅花眼见几兴亡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9308,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘后村梅花百咏 其十三","author":"方蒙仲","text":"三年朝露借恩光，剩种江梅作洞房。\n待得百年俱玉雪，冷官亦自有甘棠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9309,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘后村梅花百咏 其七十","author":"方蒙仲","text":"薜荔帷兮药作房，芳华底用浴兰汤。\n倾城梳洗祇招惎，且可随宜淡淡妆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9310,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘后村梅花百咏 其三十三","author":"方蒙仲","text":"梅叹知音少旷夔，政须我辈与伸眉。\n逋仙诗胜多多许，咀嚼无令一字遗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9311,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘后村梅花百咏 其六十","author":"方蒙仲","text":"简斋绝句天为笑，旋到调羹鼎伴来。\n只合拜梅为座主，画梅且尔况真梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9312,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘后村梅花百咏 其七十五","author":"方蒙仲","text":"旧友凋零新友少，惟梅到处只依然。\n愿言白发三千丈，饱看高花五百年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9313,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘后村梅花百咏 其五十","author":"方蒙仲","text":"痴儿安得妄评弹，刚道空花用处难。\n最是香能蠲客醉，更如玉可灭人瘢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9314,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘后村梅花百咏 其四十","author":"方蒙仲","text":"俨然盛服对严宾，肯向花中作素臣。\n映彻九泉明一世，清言须让晋诸人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9315,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘后村梅花百咏 其二十九","author":"方蒙仲","text":"雪儿按瑟侯门妒，玉女偷花帝座嗔。\n彼美人兮笑林薄，风流别是一家春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9316,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孤梅","author":"方蒙仲","text":"墙角老槎牙，槎牙阅岁华。\n谁知槁欲死，解出背时花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9317,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宜月梅","author":"方蒙仲","text":"人言广寒宫，合种梅花树。\n那知白玉容，自怕嫦娥妒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9318,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宜霜梅","author":"方蒙仲","text":"青女出骖鸾，负恃天然色。\n一等淡梳妆，太真迎虢国。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9319,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采芹亭 其十","author":"方蒙仲","text":"眼中光景几回新，无限英雄一窖尘。\n但说百年亭已老，不知曾有百年人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9320,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采芹亭 其八","author":"方蒙仲","text":"侧畔颓垣且莫支，也须别相草堂基。\n要知风月无边处，不著亭台更自奇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9321,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采芹亭 其十二","author":"方蒙仲","text":"野性于人投合少，惟山差与意中宜。\n专留一榻为渠下，绝似陈蕃见稚时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9322,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采芹亭 其十六","author":"方蒙仲","text":"见说西湖又一新，小楼高阁巧相萦。\n江山何待人妆点，堪笑吴儿不老成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9323,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采芹亭 其五","author":"方蒙仲","text":"年时桂子例先开，新岁芙蓉手自栽。\n不惜一春风雨过，许多好事待秋来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9324,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采芹亭 其十四","author":"方蒙仲","text":"屈指夫容次第开，典衣去买海棠栽。\n溪边堪插荷花否，便可四时携酒来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9325,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采芹亭 其十五","author":"方蒙仲","text":"此中小住自为佳，无柰看山眼欲花。\n把作西湖风物看，不争多否也争些。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9326,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采芹亭 其十八","author":"方蒙仲","text":"觅得广文沽酒钱，便须归隐四山环。\n岂无半幅鹅溪绢，貌取亭前一带山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9327,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采芹亭 其一","author":"方蒙仲","text":"百年亭子一朝新，三舍先生遇拂尘。\n城里看花多处所，此中只待采芹人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9328,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采芹亭 其十七","author":"方蒙仲","text":"屋老知非一木支，待时胜似有镃基。\n安知好事无来者，幻出新亭愈崛奇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9329,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采芹亭 其六","author":"方蒙仲","text":"短帽轻衫亦复家，前村后陌柳初花。\n不须多学舞雩兴，随分春光管领些。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9330,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采芹亭 其十一","author":"方蒙仲","text":"人道西南三数峰，虽云峭拔欠雍容。\n嗟哉偃娈要何用，却学为蛇羞作龙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9331,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采芹亭 其十三","author":"方蒙仲","text":"武夷山顶足仙槎，欲往从之天一涯。\n具唤小舟酹三谏，向来我祖是通家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9332,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采芹亭 其三","author":"方蒙仲","text":"宜月宜风还宜雪，烟雨冥濛景更宜。\n说与客来休剥啄，先生长是倚阑时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9333,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采芹亭 其九","author":"方蒙仲","text":"老山代出买山钱，更贴前头碧玉环。\n报答风光无一句，不知更看几州山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9334,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采芹亭 其四","author":"方蒙仲","text":"便好时时具小槎，遍游水北水南涯。\n游时要拣山深处，恐有山人处士家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9335,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"青梅如豆","author":"方蒙仲","text":"春去雨霏霏，青梅未接时。\n青青几万斛，可惜不充饥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9336,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"亭前梅","author":"方蒙仲","text":"相彼一长须，赤脚亦无有。\n二梅侍侧焉，岂不差胜不。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9337,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"信笔","author":"方蒙仲","text":"笔床茶灶答蛩吟，摇落秋风万里心。\n白发萧萧酒初醒，一龛镫火四更深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9338,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"前村梅","author":"方蒙仲","text":"何缘春信息，第一到田家。\n为甚笙歌院，重重绣幕遮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9339,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桂林吟梅","author":"方蒙仲","text":"几回桂州梦，欠一桂州诗。\n何日万里外，吟梅真大奇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9340,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"爱梅","author":"方蒙仲","text":"谩言同一嗜，世尽爱梅人。\n亦有行歌者，腰镰采作薪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9341,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"笑坐金鞍歌落梅","author":"方蒙仲","text":"谪仙豪放甚，小妾伴金鞍。\n未可将穷相，诗人一例看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9342,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鸳鸯梅","author":"方蒙仲","text":"夜半长生殿，金钗恨最长。\n分明后身是，环子伴三郎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9343,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄驿梅","author":"方蒙仲","text":"春色满梢头，所思尚千里。\n京洛贵人多，谁欤堪寄似。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9344,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"旋开梅","author":"方蒙仲","text":"邻笛不须吹，惊喷枝头雪。\n主人日日来，长见开时节。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9345,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅答","author":"方蒙仲","text":"人言是金屋，我见即柴门。\n但认安身处，区区何足论。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9346,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄香梅","author":"方蒙仲","text":"香清还耐久，粲粲镂金葩。\n想见蜂为蜡，单方采此花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9347,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"隔溪梅","author":"方蒙仲","text":"美人隔秋水，伫立柰愁何。\n剪取灵均语，临风恍浩歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9348,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"隔墙梅","author":"方蒙仲","text":"寂寂度年光，坚贞玉雪香。\n冶容谁氏子，终日傍垂杨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9349,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"溪桥梅","author":"方蒙仲","text":"一阵晓风寒，惊飞点去鞍。\n行人易愁绝，便作柳花看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9350,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynas